Package: wg-frag-go
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: WireGuard-based userspace VPN shim with large inner MTU support
 wg-frag-go is a userspace Layer 3 fragmentation and packing shim built
 around wireguard-go. It keeps a large inner IP MTU over a smaller underlay
 without changing the WireGuard handshake, encryption, or replay protection.
